    "body": "Note that it’s not just `<link rel=icon>`, but also [the implicit `/favicon.ico` request](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#rel-icon:the-link-element-2) (which could be an SVG response) that goes out in the absence of any supported `<link rel=icon>`. Not sure if the text would need to call that out separately.",
